{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["615a3165-3e78-56db-acb6-a55dd43f68d3"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["3142349b-2ca3-58d2-8549-9d7f5ebc0779"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["3ee1107e-41c4-5127-ba98-1b4506729c8e"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"I couldn't identify what changed. The ID `3142349b-2ca3-58d2-8549-9d7f5ebc0779` resolves to a STAMP (a version record), not to a concept, pattern, or semantic, so the tools can't show its content. The record shows only an ACTIVE-to-ACTIVE transition by Device Extension Author on Device Extension Module. To write a meaningful note, I need the ID of the concept or semantic that this version belongs to."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["6ee5a601-5382-5b70-a918-f6e4dc1acfa5"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["928501d9-8c01-5648-b231-3409146b3c30"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["99a2f697-b560-5174-8a33-15700084259a"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A curator extended the Indication for Use text on the Alinity 04T9120 device concept (under Alkaline Picrate, Colorimetry, Creatinine). The Creatinine2 assay statement now adds that it is to be used as an aid in the diagnosis and treatment of renal diseases, in monitoring renal dialysis, and as a calculation basis for measuring other urine analytes."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["7dba5ebe-9e80-4d4a-b237-b5d4a5c28a1a"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["5feb6fdd-2c57-4cb9-8d1e-fe70a750843a"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["e127a00d-e678-59cd-8782-5eb692907de2"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"Values for Limit of Detection, Measuring Range and Reference Ranges were not empirically tested on plasma specimens but are assumed to be equivalent to the serum sample based on Serum/Plasma bridging studies as outlined in 510K summary document."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["fbc37021-d0af-5af6-89f3-91cb6ac7a860"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["e127a00d-e678-59cd-8782-5eb692907de2"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["b0998614-408a-52aa-9729-d23304bf388e"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"I can't write a grounded note for this commit. The ID e127a00d-e678-59cd-8782-5eb692907de2 resolves to a STAMP (version metadata record), not to a concept, pattern, or semantic, so the tools can't show what content changed. The commit details (ACTIVE, Device Extension Author, Device Extension Module, previous state ACTIVE) suggest a status or metadata edit, but I can't confirm that. Please supply the UUID or SCTID of the concept, pattern, or semantic that was edited so I can describe the change."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["50a330e1-7a2f-4ed1-abd1-c9d37f0f4fcc"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["04eb542c-38c7-4d1f-9890-947aab300182"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["c5f492a1-ed1f-59a5-be60-4684a67990c7"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"There is a data discrepancy between the FDA decision summary document and the manufacturer's summary document for K210452. The values for  LoD, LoB and LoQ for Urine specimen type do not match. The values from the manufacturer's summary are used herein."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["a9bea546-f0f7-5114-85fb-54c67afd3991"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["e127a00d-e678-59cd-8782-5eb692907de2"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["ab5bbd78-4aa6-5833-a02f-accc702c18ca"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new Comment Pattern record was added to the Plasma-specimen Test Performed entry (5feb6fdd…) for Creatinine2 4500 Tests, under the Alinity 04T9120 device. It states that the LoD, measuring range, and reference ranges were not empirically tested on plasma and are assumed equivalent to serum, based on the serum/plasma bridging studies in the 510(k) summary. The comment is tagged as an Editorial Clarification."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["82da17a0-f830-5d9e-a13a-eea181a52cd8"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["c5f492a1-ed1f-59a5-be60-4684a67990c7"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["bb457f71-8d1e-554f-b682-0ffcbd79c56a"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new Comment Pattern semantic was added to the Alinity 04T9120 concept (child of Alkaline Picrate, Colorimetry, Creatinine). It records a data discrepancy between the FDA decision summary and the manufacturer's summary for K210452: the LoD, LoB and LoQ values for the Urine specimen type do not match, and the manufacturer's values were used."}]}]}}
